            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "B. Upon successful completion of training, those persons employed by MCPS as bus drivers and attendants shall receive pay for the number of hours spent in training not to exceed twenty (20) hours. The payment will be based upon the hourly starting rate for bus drivers and will be paid when they attain permanent status.",
