            "block_content": "E. Bus drivers and attendants who are assigned Head Start and WOC runs and any other like five-day (5) per week assignments on a regular and continuing basis in addition to their regularly scheduled runs shall receive credit for all hours worked on those runs. This provision is not intended to apply to those drivers who are assigned intermittently to such runs.",
